<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Rothmans six mth net up 8.8 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Rothmans six mth net up 8.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>			(in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit	     187.43	  vs     172.25</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)     66.0	   vs	60.0</p>
<p>    Turnover		 868.75	  vs     785.17</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	 267.12	  vs     245.03</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)     70.00	  vs	55.00</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name is Rothmans of Pall Mall (Malaysia) Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
